---
description: Loading buttons and in-app toast notifications for every action
globs: src/**/*.tsx,src/server/actions.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow "UI requirements" in `README.md`. In short:

- Action buttons use `SubmitButton` (form submits) or `<Button loading={pending}>` (client handlers): spinner + disabled while pending, label kept.
- Spinners use brand tints only (`Spinner` tone `onBrand` on violet/ink/pink fills, `brand` on light surfaces).
- No `alert` / `confirm` / `prompt`. CRUD outcomes surface as toasts:
  - redirecting server actions: `redirect(withNotice(path, CODE))` / `withError(path, CODE)` from `src/server/domain/notices.ts`;
  - `useActionState` actions: `useActionFeedback(state, locale, CODE)`.
- Add FR/EN copy to `noticeCopy` (success) or `errorCopy` (errors); never hard-code toast text.
